"Once everything is set up, the host will need to go to the room you'll be using for your Archipelago session on the Archipelago website. Once you have the room, you'll need click the 'Download Patch File' next to your name.\n\nAfter it is downloaded, open the Archipelago Launcher and open 'Open Patch'. It will ask you to select your patch file (.apcrystal), then, it will ask for your ROM file and finally, you'll need to select 'EmuHawk.exe' (not sure tho). It will automatically open the randomized ROM and the Text Client, once the emulation has started correctly, you can connect on the Client.\n\nOnce in game, you should be able to see the main menu mentioning 'Archipelago', simply continue to the start game screen and you can start playing!\n\nIf you have to disconnect at some point and have to reconnect, follow this guide:",
